he two deleted CLIs.\\n- [ ] Migrate known callers before removing an adapter.\\n- [ ] Retain only adapters with demonstrated unique caller/host value.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Definition Of Done\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nEach retained compatibility surface has a RETAIN or RETIRE decision backed by caller/behavior evidence; generated configurations use the correct component kind; all known callers resolve after deletion/migration; already-retired CLI risk remains explicitly recorded.\\n\\nRelated: #3932, #3933, #3486.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"dc4743d9737be9655e97426670636ee8cd6121508578dae93493868205d4ca5b\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABXCK6XQ\"}"}